  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ensuring a robust Ukrainian economy through capacity building and business</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With this project, the Norwegian-Ukrainian Chamber of Commerce seeks to strengthen the Ukrainian economy&apos;s ability to survive, improve the Ukrainian business climate and promote the Ukrainian business community&apos;s ability to interact with Europe, the Nordic countries and Norway.. Under this main objective, NUCC has promoted certain specific objectives: 
1. Support Ukrainian small and medium-sized enterprises in local capacity building and business development, with a particular focus on increased ability to interact with Norwegian, Nordic and European companies, as well as attract development capital for Ukrainian reconstruction &#x2013; Build Back Better. 
2. Develop the Ukrainian business sector&apos;s ability to interact, understand and comply with Norwegian and other foreign companies&apos; requirements for good corporate governance. 
3. Contribute to sustainable bilateral business cooperation by creating business arenas with a focus on cooperation based on good corporate governance, anti-corruption and the rule of law. 
4. Improve mutual business and cultural understanding, with the aim of increasing interest in trade between Ukrainian and Norwegian businesses.</narrative>
  </description>
